I was trying to plan my next upgrade so that it would be my last. My
question was "What will be the last version of tru64?"  Dr. Blinn's answer
was short enough to quote directly:

"I don't think anyone really knows at this point.  We have a V5.1B-1 kit
but it's really V5.1B with patches.  V5.1B with patches and support for
new hardware will be happening for some time to come.  You want to get
to V5.1B at some point, and then stay up to date with patches from time
to time.  Wait for the next V5.1B patch kit (this summer?) at least.. "

Mike Cochran



