Well that was quick and simple.  I just called HP, and it turned out that these
two systems each had a BLANK LINE in the /etc/passwd file.  Apparently this
confused dxaccounts very much, and wouldn't see any users past the blank line.
I'm not sure how a blank line got in there, but I removed it, and POOF...all my
users were automagically back in dxaccounts.

Well anyway, that's that.  Thanks again to all who replied. =)

